Q$) SQL Commands चे Types ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐----------------. What are the subsets of SQL?

SQL Commands
│
├── DDL
├── DML
├── DQL
├── DCL
└── TCL

***************DDL — Data Definition Language----------Database structure define करण्यासाठी.

CREATE
ALTER
DROP
TRUNCATE

Example:
CREATE TABLE Employee (
    id INT,
    name VARCHAR(50)
);


*************DML — Data Manipulation Language----------Data modify करण्यासाठी.

INSERT
UPDATE
DELETE

****Example:
INSERT INTO Employee VALUES (1, 'Jay');

************DQL — Data Query Language ---------------Data retrieve करण्यासाठी.

SELECT

****Example:
SELECT * FROM Employee;

************DCL — Data Control Language --------- Permissions.

GRANT
REVOKE

************TCL — Transaction Control Language-------Transactions control करण्यासाठी.

COMMIT
ROLLBACK
SAVEPOINT